---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={"WINSERV | Information Technology"}
  description={"Winserv brings 22 years of experience building IT projects that fit your company's communication and modernization needs."}
  path={"/en/"}
  ogTitle={"WINSERV — Information Technology"}
  ogDescription={"Winserv brings 22 years of experience building IT projects that fit your company's communication and modernization needs."}
  ogType={"website"}
  active={"inicio"}
>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-badge">22 years of experience in IT</div>
    <img src="/images/logo-color-rev01a.svg" alt="Winserv" aria-hidden="true" class="hero-logo">
    <h1 class="hero-wordmark"><span class="win">WIN</span><span class="serv">SERV</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">Information Technology</p>
    <p class="hero-sub">Tailor-made projects to modernize, connect and protect your company's business.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/en/solutions.html">See solutions</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="/en/contact.html">Talk to us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>




<section class="portal-promo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="portal-promo-inner">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">New product</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Winserv WiFi</h2>
        <p class="portal-promo-lead">Entra ID sign-in with MFA on your UniFi Wi-Fi. Leave the company, leave the network. The identity is the Microsoft Entra ID you already use — no domain controller, NPS or RADIUS.</p>
        <div class="portal-pills">
          <span>Microsoft sign-in + MFA</span>
          <span>Disabled in Entra, cut off in minutes</span>
          <span>Vouchers for guests</span>
          <span>HTTPS only, no RADIUS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="/en/wifi/">Discover Winserv WiFi</a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href="/en/contact.html">Talk to the team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-mockup">
        <div class="mockup-bar">
          <span class="mockup-title">Winserv WiFi &mdash; access</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">user</span>
            <span class="mockup-val">ana@company.com</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">sign-in</span>
            <span class="mockup-val">Entra ID + MFA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">group</span>
            <span class="mockup-val">&#10003; Employees</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">access</span>
            <span class="mockup-val c-text">30 days, renewable</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-sep"></div>
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">offboarding</span>
            <span class="mockup-val">cut off in minutes</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">guest</span>
            <span class="mockup-val c-text">voucher</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-row">
            <span class="mockup-key">status</span>
            <span class="mockup-val">&#9679; authorized on UniFi</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">What we do</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Our solutions</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Tailor-made projects to bring your company into the digital age.</p>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <a class="service-card" href="/en/solutions.html#cloud">
        <div class="service-icon">&#9729;</div>
        <h3>Cloud Computing</h3>
        <p>Virtualized servers, networks and systems on Azure, Google Cloud, AWS and others. Modern infrastructure without the headaches of hardware on site.</p>
        <span class="service-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service-card" href="/en/solutions.html#comms">
        <div class="service-icon">&#128222;</div>
        <h3>Communication Solutions</h3>
        <p>IP telephony, VoIP and unified communications with 3CX. Drop outdated carrier plans and bring all of your company's communication into one place.</p>
        <span class="service-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service-card" href="/en/solutions.html#monitor">
        <div class="service-icon">&#128202;</div>
        <h3>Monitoring and Auditing</h3>
        <p>Network supervision, LGPD compliance (Brazil's data protection law) and security audits. Turn legal uncertainty into proven compliance.</p>
        <span class="service-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="sobre">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">About us</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">More than two decades solving IT problems</h2>
        <p class="about-body">Winserv has 22 years of experience building projects that fit companies' communication and modernization needs. Every project starts with a careful case study and an accurate cost survey — no generic or superficial solutions.</p>
        <div class="about-stats">
          <div><div class="stat-num">22</div><div class="stat-label">years in business</div></div>
          <div><div class="stat-num">3</div><div class="stat-label">areas of work</div></div>
          <div><div class="stat-num">RS</div><div class="stat-label">Rio Grande, RS, Brazil</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ms-creds">
          <div class="ms-creds-header">
            <div class="ms-creds-label">Microsoft</div>
            <div class="ms-badges">
              <span>Partner</span>
              <span>Developer</span>
              <span>Authorized</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="ms-creds-desc">Certified partner with access to advanced Azure resources, priority technical support and development programs.</p>
          <div class="ms-id">
            <a href="https://marketplace.microsoft.com/en-US/marketplace/partner-dir/0412cc2a-f986-449e-aabb-38f70688f18f" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WINSERV TECNOLOGIA DA INFORMACAO &mdash; Partner ID: 6206323 ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-panel">
        <div class="about-item">
          <div class="about-dot"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="about-item-title">Our mission</div>
            <div class="about-item-desc">Improving lives — of clients, users and partners — through technology applied responsibly.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <div class="about-dot"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="about-item-title">Values and Principles</div>
            <div class="about-item-desc">Respect, open dialogue, delivery with clear results — our code of conduct in every project.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <div class="about-dot"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="about-item-title">Sustainable technology</div>
            <div class="about-item-desc">Responsible use of resources, and solutions that deliver efficiency without waste.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <div class="about-dot"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="about-item-title">Digital protection</div>
            <div class="about-item-desc">Education and tools to protect families and organizations online.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="alt" id="conteudo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Learn more</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Articles</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Articles and material on technology, security and good digital practice.</p>
    <div class="content-grid">
      <a class="content-card" href="/en/mission.html">
        <img src="/images/missao.webp" alt="Our mission" />
        <div class="content-card-body">
          <h3>Our mission</h3>
          <p>What defines us as a company on the journey of improving lives together with clients and users.</p>
          <span class="content-card-link">Read &#8594;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="content-card" href="/en/values.html">
        <img src="/images/valores.webp" alt="Values and Principles" />
        <div class="content-card-body">
          <h3>Values and Principles</h3>
          <p>A list of practices, goals and doctrines that define and guide us every day.</p>
          <span class="content-card-link">Read &#8594;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="content-card" href="/en/information-technology.html">
        <img src="/images/ti.webp" alt="What is IT?" />
        <div class="content-card-body">
          <h3>What is "IT"?</h3>
          <p>Ink Technicians? Internet Troubleshooters? Let's clear this idea up once and for all!</p>
          <span class="content-card-link">Read &#8594;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="content-card" href="/en/green-it.html">
        <img src="/images/tiverde.webp" alt="Green Technology" />
        <div class="content-card-body">
          <h3>Green Technology</h3>
          <p>How the responsible use of sustainable resources can secure a future for everyone.</p>
          <span class="content-card-link">Read &#8594;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="content-card" href="/en/screen-time.html">
        <img src="/images/telas.webp" alt="Excessive Screen Time" />
        <div class="content-card-body">
          <h3>Excessive Screen Time</h3>
          <p>Understand why uncontrolled exposure to screens can have unexpected consequences.</p>
          <span class="content-card-link">Read &#8594;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="content-card" href="/en/internet-filter.html">
        <img src="/images/filtro.webp" alt="Filtering the Internet" />
        <div class="content-card-body">
          <h3>Filtering the Internet</h3>
          <p>Practical tips to block inappropriate content and protect your children online.</p>
          <span class="content-card-link">Read &#8594;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="cta-strip">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Ready to modernize your company?</h2>
    <p>We survey all of your needs before proposing any solution.</p>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="/en/contact.html">Talk to the team</a>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
